# Send only the files the demo image needs. Never send retained witness stores,
# raw synthetic keys, old release bundles, a local environment, or Git metadata.
**
!Dockerfile.demo
!Dockerfile.demo.dockerignore
!requirements.lock
!pyproject.toml
!LICENSE
!README.md
!vote_lab/
!vote_lab/**
!docs/
!docs/**
!tests/
!tests/**

# Deny generated files even within the allowed source/documentation trees.
**/__pycache__/**
**/*.pyc
**/*.pyo
**/.env
**/*.pem
**/*.key
**/signing-key.bin
**/local-role-stores/**

# Derived provenance references image IDs; it is review evidence, not runtime
# input, and stays outside the image to avoid a self-referential image hash.
docs/openline-vote/validation/**
